# Refresh Prince: Evolution X on the HiBreak starts with debug.sf.nobootanimation=1 (only the
# Bigme logo shows). Turn the boot screen back on before SurfaceFlinger starts it; post-fs-data is the
# same point at which the Magisk version of this pack sets it (verified on the phone, Oct 26 2026).
on post-fs-data
    setprop debug.sf.nobootanimation 0
